{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_8000_situation", "source_sha256": "df7e905582089f19789355d95376536c02e33291bec3890e35ab61b7a6d69c3a", "ja": "グラビアのお仕事　撮影前", "zh": "写真拍摄工作　拍摄前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_8000_place", "source_sha256": "f60ef7fdebd576a02f411840ca2accc9e6c44e39eb11778dae54c53abff981be", "ja": "海沿い", "zh": "海边", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_8001_p", "source_sha256": "76a6c82743528f2e1558e313453f8841e70a8426a875e0b921fe84744cf0c5e7", "ja": "（アイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』のグラビア企画。\nテーマは『舞姫と海』。本番まで環の相手をしている）", "zh": "（偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》的写真特辑。\n主题是“舞姬与大海”。正式拍摄前一直陪着环）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_8002_040tam", "source_sha256": "d54212ac728dac16f27c4abaa5bece9d5d88a3412c03e0dbe71548a9bdb6ecba", "ja": "マイヒメレッド参上だぞ～！\n海の平和は、ぜったいに守ってみせる！", "zh": "舞姬红登场啦～！\n海洋的和平，我绝对会守护到底！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_8003_p", "source_sha256": "9cf70c5d4b437c6ec005140398a277479a78d92ffa56f089d16597bd689884de", "ja": "ひっひっひ。現れたな、マイヒメレッド……！\n俺様の真の力を見せてやろう！", "zh": "嘻嘻嘻。你终于出现了，舞姬红……！\n就让你见识一下本大爷真正的力量吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_8004_040tam", "source_sha256": "c03ffa52694c3bcd20fdbf4d81dfe58fe2a683da922035e125674db78ac74adb", "ja": "望むところだ！　これでもくらえ～！\nひっさーつ！　えっと、えっと……。", "zh": "正合我意！吃我这一招～！\n必——杀——！呃，呃……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_8005_040tam", "source_sha256": "f7cd2b73a4b3fcbfeae41d4d47043e71c32174a57ded0d6edfb0843ea2743782", "ja": "おやぶん、待って！　たまき、必殺技の名前\n考えてなかった……えへへ。何がいいかな～？", "zh": "老大，等等！　环的必杀技名字还没想好……嘿嘿。叫什么好呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_8006", "source_sha256": "9ec84cabb296f21f243a4206400eac8a7bf43ebaf07f60ba6bd0e6e95c8f596f", "ja": "マイヒメピュアビーム", "zh": "我的公主纯真光束", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_8007", "source_sha256": "2c2b6610ac25571456e7bc76ef57f223d0099950897a97afa5e1d67ded0a333c", "ja": "ふわふわキック", "zh": "蓬松飞踢", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_8008", "source_sha256": "1cd74a4d782f36d66e235c2d467977cc9ca3aafdfc57ef65d7afb93beccc01a5", "ja": "歌舞音曲アタック", "zh": "歌舞音曲攻击", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_8100_p", "source_sha256": "561a8b8d49140044446792154e2b12d6ded25d42d6b64ce595b48b42664d7c99", "ja": "『マイヒメピュアビーム』っていうのはどうだ？\n舞姫の不思議なパワーを放つ、赤いビームだ！", "zh": "叫作“我的公主纯洁光束”怎么样？\n这是释放舞姬神秘力量的红色光束！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_8101_040tam", "source_sha256": "dc41e145fbf2ef25b76b7e82eae597f5962efb06ef2624d87b8c34743e2fa688", "ja": "おお～！　赤いビーム、すっごく強そう！\nカッコいいぞ～！　たまき、やってみる！", "zh": "哦哦～！红色光束，看起来超级厉害！\n好帅啊～！环，来试试看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_8102_040tam", "source_sha256": "6a8e3159369cddced0ecdf609c3d472109115b1d47274e12bb44286bdbfa6218", "ja": "くらえ～！　マイヒメピュアビーム！\nビビビビビー！　……これで海は平和になったね♪", "zh": "接招～！我的公主纯洁光线！\n哔哔哔哔哔——！……这样海面就和平了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_8200_p", "source_sha256": "51dabc906ea95a450e8d1dc0982daf021ea5609ce191e1dd11b08d3c7a0c523a", "ja": "『ふわふわキック』っていうのはどうかな？\n舞を舞うように軽やかにキックするんだ。", "zh": "叫“轻飘飘踢击”怎么样？\n要像跳舞一样轻盈地踢出去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_8201_040tam", "source_sha256": "1678c88067ca977057ad6848d058e521d28e1dfa090b2c3bb7e1a415574458df", "ja": "えっと……ダンスしながらキックするってこと？\nたまき、ちょっと練習してみる！", "zh": "那个……是说一边跳舞一边踢吗？\n环，稍微练习一下看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_8202_040tam", "source_sha256": "d8f84d3224e0af1883857c072de47cd2d7616ba5d85c9b572b5c57d314975f38", "ja": "くるっと回ってー……ふわふわキックキック\nキーック！　……なんか面白い技できたかも、くふふ！", "zh": "转个圈——……轻飘飘踢踢\n踢——！……好像练成了什么有趣的招式，嘿嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_8300_p", "source_sha256": "1c85d0d8b794fb609ad0b027b5e0ecb48a7160bbe0392c215fe3fe58b66140b4", "ja": "『歌舞音曲アタック』っていうのはどうだろう？\n歌と舞と音楽の合体技で、すごく強いと思うんだ！", "zh": "叫作“歌舞音曲攻击”怎么样？\n这是歌、舞蹈和音乐的合体技，我觉得一定非常强！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_8301_040tam", "source_sha256": "f4e2f22a5f4fd1e7262d13473fff9096894fba46c1e3b542d8b885eab7bc8c28", "ja": "カブ……おん、ぎょく？\nなんか、たまきにはちょっと難しいぞ……。", "zh": "歌舞……音曲？\n总觉得对环来说有点难懂……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_8302_040tam", "source_sha256": "45c6f19b0eb008251934adb2ad7b82acffa7100b9518e85fbd2156c9c1fca19d", "ja": "ダンスみたいに、お手本があればできると\n思うけど……。ねえ、おやぶん！　やってみて！", "zh": "我觉得要是有像跳舞那样的示范，应该就能做到……对吧，老大！你来试试！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
